config TOUCHSCREEN_XIAOMI_TOUCHFEATURE
	tristate "Xiaomi Touch Feature"
	depends on INPUT_TOUCHSCREEN
	help
		Say Y here if you enable xiaomi touch feature.

		If unsure, say N.

		To compile this driver as a module, choose M here:
		the module will be called xiaomi_touch.

config INPUT_XIAOMI_PEN
	tristate "Xiaomi Redmi / POCO Pen support"
	depends on INPUT && TOUCHSCREEN_XIAOMI_TOUCHFEATURE
	help
		Say Y here if you want to use the Redmi Pen or POCO Pen
		active stylus on Xiaomi ruan platform tablets
		(Redmi Pad Pro / POCO Pad).

		This registers an input device ("Redmi/POCO Pen") that reports
		pen contact, pressure, buttons (BTN_STYLUS / BTN_STYLUS2) and
		tilt (ABS_TILT_X / ABS_TILT_Y). It relies on the Xiaomi touch
		feature for pen connection state.

		To compile this driver as a module, choose M here:
		the module will be called xiaomi_pen.

		If unsure, say N.
